---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"; import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro"; import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact | Glavas Engineering"><SiteHeader /><main><section class="section"><div class="container contact-page"><div><p class="eyebrow">Contact</p><h1>Discuss a project</h1></div><div class="contact-page__copy"><p class="lead">Send the relevant drawings and a brief description of the required thermal assessment.</p><p>This may include U-value calculations, condensation risk assessment, Psi- or Chi-value calculations, or other 2D and 3D thermal modelling.</p><h2>Where available, include:</h2><ul><li>Construction details or drawings</li><li>Required calculation</li><li>Project location</li><li>Applicable standard or assessment criteria</li><li>Deadline</li></ul><p>If the scope is not fully defined, send the available information and we can discuss the appropriate assessment, including which details and criteria should be considered.</p><p class="email-label">Email: <a href="mailto:your-email@example.com">[your email]</a></p></div></div></section></main><SiteFooter /></BaseLayout>
<style>
  .contact-page{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4rem}.contact-page__copy{max-width:42rem}.contact-page p{color:var(--color-slate)}.contact-page .lead{font-size:1.25rem}.contact-page h2{margin-top:3rem;font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.3rem)}.contact-page ul{padding-left:1.2rem;color:var(--color-slate)}.contact-page li{padding:.25rem 0}.email-label{margin-top:3rem}.email-label a{color:var(--color-teal);font-weight:500}.contact-page .email-label a:hover{color:var(--color-charcoal)}@media(max-width:44rem){.contact-page{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}}
</style>
